# Ubuntu Core device bringup
[ ] Obtain hardware and confirm it powers on
[ ] Identify SoC, boot ROM, and storage type
[ ] Source or build the appropriate gadget snap
[ ] Source or build the kernel snap with required drivers
[ ] Create model assertion for the device
[ ] Build test image: ubuntu-image snap <model>
[ ] Flash image to device storage
[ ] Boot and capture first boot console output
[ ] Confirm first boot completes successfully
[ ] SSH access working
[ ] snap list matches expected seeded snaps
[ ] All snap interfaces connected
[ ] No errors in snap changes
[ ] Network connectivity verified
[ ] Serial port access verified
[ ] Secure boot status confirmed
[ ] TPM provisioning confirmed (if applicable)
[ ] OTA update tested: snap refresh
[ ] Recovery mode tested
[ ] Factory reset tested
[ ] Document any hardware-specific workarounds
